== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From {{gen}} of ''[[faðir#Icelandic|faðir]]'' meaning "[[father]]" (= ''[[föður]]'' meaning "of a father") + ''[[bróðir#Icelandic|bróðir]]'' meaning "[[brother#English|brother]]". Literally meaning "brother of a father" or "father's brother".
=== Noun ===
'''föðurbróðir''' {{m}}

# [[paternal]] [[uncle]]

